<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug television output 18.14 mln units.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug television output 18.14 mln units.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 18.14 million television sets in January-August of 1996, the Market Daily said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some 12.34 million of those were colour television sets, up 3.96 percent from the same period last year, the newspaper quoted official statistics as saying.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
